<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 418,500 shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 418,500 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it had bought back a further 418,500 shares on Wednesday between NZ$6.31 and $6.37 in its $1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The shares closed two cents stronger at NZ$6.37.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
